; Why: Catspaw DLTX still patches missing [1]; Exo System writes into
;      workshop_autoinject.LoadRecipes, which CSI v4 no longer calls.
;      craft_-500 is Devices; craft_-510 is the empty Exo System tab
;      that CSI otherwise drops in check_empty_tabs.
; Exo set is the 7-recipe list from the old archive: handmade / military /
; proto / tank / sprint / jump / invis. Corpse drop of the military PSU
; stays in exo_loot.script (10%/3%); craft is an extra path, not a replace.

